        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "TRIBE TRITICEAE (C3, temperate)\n  ├── Wheat (Triticum): 42 chromosomes (hexaploid), N. hemisphere winter/spring crop\n  │     Yield: ~800 kg/ha (traditional) → 3,500+ kg/ha (Green Revolution dwarf varieties)\n  ├── Barley (Hordeum vulgare): 14 chromosomes (diploid); beer + animal feed + some food\n  └── Rye (Secale cereale): cold-hardy; fermentation (rye bread, whiskey)"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-GRAINS.md#006",
      "path": [
        "01-GRAINS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
