        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "TRIBE PANICEAE (C4, warm-season)\n  ├── Pearl millet (Pennisetum): semi-arid Africa/India; drought champion\n  └── Foxtail millet (Setaria italica): earliest domesticated grain (~8000 BP, China)"
    },
    {
