      },
      "text": "NON-GRASS \"PSEUDOCEREALS\" (Amaranthaceae, Polygonaceae):\n  Quinoa, amaranth: complete amino acid profile (unlike true grains)\n  Buckwheat: not related to wheat; gluten-free; routed by Maillard reaction (soba noodles)"
    },
