        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Grains - The Grass Family Feeds the World",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "GRASS → GRAIN → CIVILIZATION\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nWILD GRASSES                    DOMESTICATED GRAINS\n~50 Mya: Grass family evolves   ~10,500 BP: First cereal cultivation\nDense starchy seeds             Non-shattering rachis selected\nWind pollination                Human selection for seed size/yield\nAnnual lifecycle                Annual lifecycle maintained\nLow seed yield/plant            Massive yield increase over millennia\nMultiple dispersal              Harvested and stored\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-GRAINS.md#012",
      "path": [
        "01-GRAINS.md"
