      "text": "Bran      ← fiber, B vitamins, minerals\n  Endosperm ← starch + storage proteins (gluten in wheat)\n  Germ      ← fats, vitamins E/B, proteins\nWhite flour = endosperm only. Whole grain = all three layers.\n```"
